
---
const links = [
  { href: "/", label: "Home" },
  { href: "/#approach", label: "Methodology" },
  { href: "/institute", label: "Institute" },
  { href: "/academy", label: "Academy" },
  { href: "/partnerships", label: "RMS" },
  { href: "/command-centre", label: "Command Centre" },
  { href: "/insights", label: "Insights" },
  { href: "/resources", label: "Resources" },
  { href: "/media", label: "Media Centre" },
  { href: "/partners", label: "Partners" },
  { href: "/about", label: "About" },
  { href: "/contact", label: "Contact" },
];
---

<footer>

  <div class="footer-inner">

    <div class="footer-top">

      <!-- Brand -->

      <div>

        <div class="footer-brand-logo">
          <img
            src="/assets/kiprod-logo-2026.png"
            alt="KIPROD"
            class="brand-logo-img"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="footer-brand-desc">
  KIPROD is an institutional engagement ecosystem helping financial institutions strengthen governance, capability, operational execution, and long-term performance through a structured seven-stage methodology.
</div>

      </div>

      <!-- Navigation -->

      <div>

        <div class="footer-col-title">
          Explore
        </div>

        <ul class="footer-links">
          {links.map((l) => (
            <li>
              <a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

      </div>

      <!-- Journey -->

      <div>

        <div class="footer-col-title">
          Institutional Engagement Journey
        </div>

        <div class="footer-journey">

<div>① Assessment (ILCA)</div>

<span>↓</span>

<div>② Discovery (ICDF)</div>

<span>↓</span>

<div>③ Assessment Report (ICAR)</div>

<span>↓</span>

<div>④ Capability Roadmap</div>

<span>↓</span>

<div>⑤ Academy</div>

<span>↓</span>

<div>⑥ RMS Implementation</div>

<span>↓</span>

<div>⑦ Command Centre</div>

</div>

      </div>

      <!-- Focus -->

      <div>

        <div class="footer-col-title">
          Institution Types
        </div>

        <div class="footer-badges">

          <span>Banks</span>
<span>SACCOs</span>
<span>Microfinance</span>
<span>Credit Providers</span>
<span>Government</span>
<span>Regulators</span>
<span>DFIs</span>
<span>Co-operatives</span>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="footer-divider"></div>

    <div class="footer-cta">

      <h3>
        Ready to Begin Your Institutional Journey?
      </h3>

      <p>
        Every engagement begins with understanding your institution's current capability. Through assessment, discovery, capability development, implementation, and continuous performance support, KIPROD provides a structured pathway to stronger institutional outcomes.
      </p>

      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">
        Start Institutional Capability Assessment →
      </a>

    </div>

    <div class="footer-divider"></div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">

<div class="footer-copy">
© 2026 KIPROD Institute. All Rights Reserved.
</div>

<div class="footer-markets">
Governance • Capability Development • Executive Learning • Implementation • Institutional Intelligence
</div>

</div>

  </div>

</footer>